{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57572","headline":"中方歌 · 无名氏","name":"中方歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中央戊己属句陈，体合虚无与道隣。\n纯抱元和精粹气，陶身万炼緫成真。\n木妻火子水家鬼，水土相镇不能起。\n还教却产西方金，递代相承壮精髓。\n虽然我身无正形，志事隈凭四象生。\n四象不因连我气，水金木火岂能成？\n徧通金木恩情熟，留向胎中亲养育。\n丽物相和气緫幷，须凭丙火来煎蹙。\n丙火元来是我命，节候轮排依法令。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}